---
import Layout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
import styles from "../styles/privacy.module.scss";

const CONTACT_EMAIL = "contact@veinspire-games.com";
const COMPANY_NAME = "Veinspire Games";
const LEGAL_NAME = "Individual Entrepreneur Petr Petrov";
const REGISTRATION_DATE = "7 November 2024";
const LAST_UPDATED = "29 September 2026";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Notice — Veinspire Games" description="How Veinspire Games collects and uses personal data through this website.">
  <section class={styles.page}>
    <div class={styles.container}>
      <h1>Privacy Notice</h1>

      <p>
        This notice explains how {COMPANY_NAME}, operated by {LEGAL_NAME} in Georgia, collects and uses personal data
        through veinspire-games.com. It applies to website visitors, people who contact us about business
        opportunities, and people who send us information directly by email.
      </p>

      <p>
        For privacy questions or requests, contact us at
        <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Data controller</h2>
      <p>
        The data controller is {LEGAL_NAME}, an individual entrepreneur registered in Georgia on {REGISTRATION_DATE}
        and trading as {COMPANY_NAME}. Privacy requests and questions can be sent to
        <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <p>We may collect the following categories of information:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>contact details that you provide, including your name and email address;</li>
        <li>your company name and the content of your message;</li>
        <li>your marketing preference when you choose whether to receive communications from us;</li>
        <li>technical request data processed by our hosting, form, and security providers, such as IP address, browser type, device information, timestamps, and security signals; and</li>
        <li>information that you voluntarily send to us by email, including a CV or portfolio if you choose to do so.</li>
      </ul>

      <p>
        Please do not send special-category or highly sensitive personal data through the contact form. We do not use
        the website to intentionally collect biometric data, government identification numbers, payment data, or health information.
      </p>

      <h2>Why we use personal data</h2>

      <h3>Business inquiries</h3>
      <p>
        We use contact details and message content to respond to inquiries, discuss a possible engagement, prepare a
        proposal, and maintain necessary business correspondence. Depending on the context, we rely on steps taken at
        your request before entering into a contract and on our legitimate interest in operating and developing our business.
      </p>

      <h3>Website security</h3>
      <p>
        We process limited technical data to deliver the website, prevent spam and abuse, investigate failures, and
        protect the security of the site. We rely on our legitimate interest in providing a secure and reliable service.
      </p>

      <h3>Marketing communications</h3>
      <p>
        We send marketing communications only when you select the optional marketing checkbox or otherwise give us
        permission. You may withdraw that consent at any time by replying to a message or emailing
        <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>. Declining marketing does not prevent you from submitting a business inquiry.
      </p>

      <h3>Legal obligations</h3>
      <p>
        We may keep or disclose limited information where necessary to comply with applicable law, establish or defend
        legal claims, or respond to a lawful request from an authority.
      </p>

      <h2>Service providers and recipients</h2>
      <p>We use the following providers to operate this website:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Formspree</strong> receives, stores, and routes submissions from the contact form. Formspree states
          that its service is hosted on Amazon Web Services in the United States and that it relies on Standard
          Contractual Clauses as a data processor. See the
          <a href="https://formspree.io/security/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Formspree security information</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Google reCAPTCHA</strong> helps detect spam and abuse. Google may process device, network, cookie,
          and interaction data under its own
          <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Privacy Policy</a>
          and <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Terms of Service</a>.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>GitHub Pages</strong> hosts the website and may process technical request and security-log data under
          the <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub Privacy Statement</a>.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <p>
        We may also share relevant information with professional advisers or public authorities when reasonably
        necessary and legally permitted. We do not sell personal data.
      </p>

      <h2>International transfers</h2>
      <p>
        Some providers may process data outside Georgia or the country where you live, including in the United States.
        Where applicable law requires transfer safeguards, we rely on the contractual and legal mechanisms made
        available by those providers, including Standard Contractual Clauses where appropriate.
      </p>

      <h2>Retention</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Business inquiries are normally retained for up to 24 months after the last substantive communication.</li>
        <li>Marketing contact details are retained until you withdraw consent or after 24 months without meaningful engagement, whichever occurs first.</li>
        <li>Unsolicited recruitment information sent directly to us is normally retained for up to 12 months, unless you agree to a longer period.</li>
        <li>Information needed for contracts, accounting, disputes, or legal compliance may be retained for the period required by applicable law.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Our service providers may retain technical and security information under their own policies and contractual terms.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies and browser storage</h2>
      <p>
        We do not currently use advertising or audience-analytics cookies. The site uses browser
        <code>sessionStorage</code> to remember whether certain page animations have already played during the current
        browsing session. This information remains in your browser and is not used to identify you.
      </p>
      <p>
        Google reCAPTCHA may use cookies or similar technology to assess whether a contact-form submission is genuine.
        You can control cookies through your browser settings, although blocking them may prevent the contact form from working correctly.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Depending on where you live and which law applies, you may have the right to request access to, correction of,
        deletion of, or restriction of your personal data; to object to processing; to receive portable data; and to
        withdraw consent without affecting earlier lawful processing.
      </p>
      <p>
        Send a request to <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>. We may ask for information needed to
        verify your identity before completing the request.
      </p>
      <p>
        You may also lodge a complaint with the competent supervisory authority. In Georgia, information is available
        from the <a href="https://pdps.ge/en" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Personal Data Protection Service</a>.
        If the GDPR applies to your situation, you may contact the data-protection authority in the EU or EEA country where you live or work.
      </p>

      <h2>Automated decisions</h2>
      <p>
        We do not use information submitted through this website to make decisions based solely on automated processing
        that produce legal or similarly significant effects. reCAPTCHA performs automated security checks to identify likely abuse.
      </p>

      <h2>External links</h2>
      <p>
        The website links to third-party services and social networks. Their own privacy notices apply when you visit them.
      </p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>
        This business website is not directed to children, and we do not knowingly collect personal data from children through it.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to this notice</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this notice when our website, providers, or legal obligations change. We will publish the updated
        version on this page and revise the date below.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Privacy requests and questions: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.
      </p>

      <hr class={styles.rule} />
      <p class={styles.small}>Last updated: {LAST_UPDATED}</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
